description:
Send a message on the 360Dialog sandbox. Messages can only be sent to the user's phone number that was used during sandbox registration.

The payload must be a JSON string matching the WhatsApp messages endpoint body.

Interactive message example: use this only when there is an active conversation window, which lasts 24 hours since the customer's last message.

{
  "messaging_product": "whatsapp",
  "to": "{{recipient_phone_number}}",
  "type": "text",
  "text": {
    "body": "{{message_body}}"
  }
}

Template message example: use this when there is no active conversation window, or when sending an approved template message. You can only send the 'marketing_message' template.

{
  "messaging_product": "whatsapp",
  "to": "{{recipient_phone_number}}",
  "type": "template",
  "template": {
    "name": "marketing_message",
    "language": {
      "policy": "deterministic",
      "code": "en"
    },
    "components": [
      {
        "type": "header",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "image": {
              "link": "https://placehold.co/600x315/34D399/FFFFFF/png?text=Summer+Sale!"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
